    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your position and showcase your strategic precision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling action and survival game, you take control of a tank stationed at the intersection of four paths. Your goal is clear: shoot with precision to destroy the enemy ships advancing along each path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key gameplay mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic shooting:</strong> Every shot counts. Fire only when necessary, as shooting more times than required will hit the city, and you\u2019ll lose a life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-sensitive defense:</strong> If an enemy ship reaches your position, you\u2019ll lose a life. Stay calm and act quickly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless waves:</strong> Face endless waves of enemy ships that will test your reflexes, strategy, and ability to hold out for as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple yet challenging gameplay, this game will keep you on the edge of your seat as you plan every shot with precision. Perfect for those who love challenges and want to beat their own records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background image of this game's main menu has been generated using artificial intelligence. All other visual content has been created manually.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your position and showcase your strategic precision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling action and survival game, you take control of a tank stationed at the intersection of four paths. Your goal is clear: shoot with precision to destroy the enemy ships advancing along each path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key gameplay mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic shooting:</strong> Every shot counts. Fire only when necessary, as shooting more times than required will hit the city, and you\u2019ll lose a life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-sensitive defense:</strong> If an enemy ship reaches your position, you\u2019ll lose a life. Stay calm and act quickly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless waves:</strong> Face endless waves of enemy ships that will test your reflexes, strategy, and ability to hold out for as long as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple yet challenging gameplay, this game will keep you on the edge of your seat as you plan every shot with precision. Perfect for those who love challenges and want to beat their own records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background image of this game's main menu has been generated using artificial intelligence. All other visual content has been created manually.</p>",
